* Deliverable: the 3-bit flash ADC. Pin order is fixed; see /app/spec/README.md.
* Local parameter-free helper subcircuits (comparator, latch, gates) may be defined above the DUT.
* Primitive examples:
* XN d g s b sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=2 nf=1
* XP d g s b sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
* R1 a b 500
* C1 a b 100f
.subckt flash_adc_3bit vss vdd vrefn vrefp clk vin b2 b1 b0
.ends flash_adc_3bit
